  "title": "Sweet and Simple Pork Chops",
  "description": "This is so simple, yet delicious. Store bought apple sauce may be substituted for the apple and sugar mixture. Serve with new potatoes and side salad.",
  "authors": [
    "Freakowd40"
  ],
